The following are sample scripts for various runs in the manuscript.

scream-v1_script is valid for the two resolutions of SCREAM v1 runs.
e3sm-mam_script is valid for E3SM-MAM runs.
e3sm-spa_script is valid for E3SM-SPA runs.

Note that these scripts are simply samples, and will likely be
out-of-date as machine configurations change.

Get in touch with authors for more information on how to reproduce
the runs in the future, if desired.

You may need the SPA input files, which are stored in the following link.
https://web.lcrc.anl.gov/public/e3sm/inputdata/atm/scream/init/.

spa_from_eamv3.ne4np4.F2010.2011-2025.c_20240405.nc
